  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 5.1, 'Essential components of a digital health implementation'. Across the top: HEALTH CONTENT (information aligned with recommended health practices) + DIGITAL HEALTH INTERVENTIONS (discrete functions of digital technology for health-sector objectives) → DIGITAL APPLICATIONS (software and communication channels that deliver them, supported by shared services). Dotted lines tie this to the SERVICES & APPLICATIONS block of a foundational layer, 'ICT and Enabling Environment', made of the building blocks: leadership and governance across the top, above strategy and investment; services and applications; standards and interoperability; infrastructure; legislation, policy and compliance; and workforce.",
